<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market help at set rates.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market help at set rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 1.050 billion stg of assistance at established interest rates.</p>
<p>			    EARLY	1100 GMT   1300 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.8 BLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    1.050 BLN# =	    =	    =</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p> BAND 1  BANK BILLS    150 MLN*  =	    =	    =</p>
<p># INCLUDES 900 MLN STG BILLS/FRG FOR RESALE SEPT 16 AT 5-23/32</p>
<p>PCT</p>
<p>* INTEREST RATE - 5-11/16 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
